; Find the next newer phrase record
;
; IX = the nearest record below IY on the phrase stack whose RECF_EXCEPT flag
; (bit 6 of byte +1) is clear; falls into the search of #R$78A5 with the step
; -PARSED_RECORD_SIZE.
;
; IY Current record
; O:IX The next newer record
@label=FindNewerRecord
c$789F PUSH DE       ;
@isub=LD DE,-PARSED_RECORD_SIZE
 $78A0 LD DE,$FFE8   ; step down: newer
 $78A3 JR $78A9      ; search
